                                "sense_id": "ed4c3aa3-7753-3525-b72c-20b195c9a816",
                                "text": "Grace lotions her arms and legs and joins him in the large walk-in closet where they change out of their clothes and into their pajamas—loose-fitting cotton bottoms for Mike and a lace-trimmed baby doll nightie for Grace."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f83d66b3-b87b-4022-ac6f-7ef5bddae910",
                                "sense_id": "ed4c3aa3-7753-3525-b72c-20b195c9a816",
                                "text": "I would finish my daily ranging session by lotioning his legs, and lotioning and rubbing his feet."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
